# generated by `npm run sql:bundle`: the four migrations in one file, for pasting
# into Supabase Studio when the CLI is not to hand. Generated, but committed on
# purpose — somebody setting the project up from a browser has no bundler to run,
# and a file they cannot download is a file that does not exist. Re-run
# `npm run sql:bundle` after any migration change and commit the result.
